' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0006-web-ui - configured bootstrap operator + team env and secret write without auth

participant "Web UI / Browser" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "State Registry" as State

UI -> GW : submit env vars and secret values\n(no selected team, no operator)
GW -> GW : strip client X-FlowAI-* context\nvalidate configured bootstrap operator + team\ngenerate request_id
alt configured bootstrap operator or team context invalid
  GW --> UI : reject before write
else valid configured bootstrap operator and team
  GW -> State : store request with configured Operator-ID\n(audit attribution only), configured Team-ID,\ndisplay-only Team-Name, Request-ID
  State -> State : enforce environment/secret ownership by team_id;\nattribute to operator_id + request_id
  State --> GW : environment and secret identifiers or denial
  GW --> UI : status, headers, and body unchanged
end

@enduml
